      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.8,
      "end_seconds": 8.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.4,
      "end_seconds": 14.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "I'm here cos of being breathless on stairs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.07,
      "end_seconds": 19.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "how many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.28,
      "end_seconds": 23.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "About... well, two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.74,
      "end_seconds": 28.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Okay, go on. Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.33,
      "end_seconds": 44.78,
      "duration_seconds": 15.45,
      "text": "It usually comes with very heavy periods. The very heavy periods? That's been for one week. About very heavy periods, it settles a little with double protection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.88,
      "end_seconds": 59.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.88,
      "end_seconds": 71.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "okay, this won't take long.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.62,
      "end_seconds": 88.12,
      "duration_seconds": 6.5,
      "text": "okay: temperature 36.7, pulse is 119 beats a minute, blood pressure 112 over 70."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.03,
      "end_seconds": 94.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "let me look at the area, I'll be gentle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.71,
      "end_seconds": 96.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Yes, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.25,
      "end_seconds": 100.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.42,
      "end_seconds": 118.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "Your inner eyelids are pale and your pulse is a little fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.68,
      "end_seconds": 126.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "All finished, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.23,
      "end_seconds": 146.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Any pain or fainting at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.61,
      "end_seconds": 150.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.91,
      "end_seconds": 155.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Right, has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.98,
      "end_seconds": 163.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "No, um, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.19,
      "end_seconds": 182.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.57,
      "end_seconds": 188.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "Naproxen. I take it 250 milligrams, twice a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.41,
      "end_seconds": 193.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "did you ever have any procedures done?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.13,
      "end_seconds": 211.37,
      "duration_seconds": 17.24,
      "text": "Yes, I had a cataract operation in my left eye, about a year ago. My family kept telling me to get it checked. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.46,
      "end_seconds": 218.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "Do you react to to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.78,
      "end_seconds": 223.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.98,
      "end_seconds": 227.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Okay, now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.11,
      "end_seconds": 239.99,
      "duration_seconds": 10.88,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day. I look after my grandchildren most days. I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.41,
      "end_seconds": 245.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.09,
      "end_seconds": 250.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "I've got arthritis in my knees"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.67,
      "end_seconds": 271.71,
      "duration_seconds": 13.04,
      "text": "let me tell you where I've got to this is probably heavy periods with iron deficiency i want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 273.31,
      "end_seconds": 275.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.91,
      "end_seconds": 303.43,
      "duration_seconds": 26.52,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with heavy periods with iron deficiency do well once it's treated properly. A ferritin level is what I'd like next, for heavy periods. I'm gonna put you on ferrous sulfate, 200 milligrams, once a day, three months. That's for iron deficiency. Keep a pad count diary. Book a review after the results."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.39,
      "end_seconds": 306.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "I can manage that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.03,
      "end_seconds": 310.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Alright, I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.76,
      "end_seconds": 313.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "thank you, doctor, goodbye"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
